      "body": "Review:\n\nTried all slices to check current deliverables from milestone -\n\n```\njatin@Jatinp26:/mnt/d/workspace$ git clone https://github.com/unlockitio/concordia\ncd concordia\ngit checkout dev\ndpm build --all\ndpm test --package-root examples/governance/private-majority-vote/demo\ndpm test --package-root examples/auctions/sealed-bid-first-price/demo\ndpm test --package-root examples/governance/baby-dso/cap/demo\n```\n\n- ran the `./scripts/sandbox-test.sh` to check it all. \n ```\naBidderCannotBlockTheSale SUCCESS\nlotGoesToTheHighestPresentedBid SUCCESS\nsettlementRejectsAnImpostorAllocation SUCCESS\nsettlementRunsThroughTheFactoriesTheTermsName SUCCESS\nwhoSeesWhat SUCCESS\n\naDriftedFeeStopsBoth SUCCESS\naFeeChangeMidVoteSplitsTheBallots SUCCESS\nanEpochBumpMidVoteStillAgrees SUCCESS\nanUnrelatedChangeIsAdmitted SUCCESS\nbothFeesMoveTogether SUCCESS\ntwoPathsOneAction SUCCESS\n```\n- Total 14/14 scripts, all SUCCESS on Canton sandbox\n- Good to sign-off on M2 from my side.\n\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8093312-11e1-4161-965a-b713154b2a8e\" /> <img width=\"400\" height=\"310\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1584ff75-d0d5-420b-ae28-9f239e7d0265\" /> <img width=\"650\" height=\"450\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2f1db18-7f66-40c0-a842-ad6badc8e846\" />",
